{
  "id": 201096631,
  "iid": 9594,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "wiretap: treat file extensions case-insensitively",
  "description": "Modify `get_file_extension()` to convert the filename to all lower-case,\nso the file extension(s) are returned as such. This effectively makes\n`heuristic_uses_extension()` operate case-insensitively, since it's\ncomparing against the extensions in `open_routines[]` which are also\nstored in lower-case.\n\nCloses #18821",
  "state": "merged",
